cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Plastr: an interactive assembly graph studio"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Lorenzin
    given-names: Giovanni
repository-code: "https://github.com/iowa69/plaster"
abstract: >-
  Plastr combines Bandage-style assembly graph visualisation with
  QUAST-style reference-based quality assessment, and adds reference-guided
  scaffolding whose gaps are filled with real sequence recovered from the
  assembly graph. It exports scaffolds as FASTA with a matching AGP.
keywords:
  - bioinformatics
  - genome assembly
  - assembly graph
  - GFA
  - scaffolding
  - quality assessment
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
